"P692460268" "Nicely done. Now the conflict between the Council and the 5th Column is in full swing. When Nosferatu arrives with his full contingent of Vampyri, the Center will not look a gift quadruped in the mouth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
