// 27 B_Boss :
"P762830583" "<em Point t=6>You, my most loyal of subjects, are to be privy to a secret. <em t=5>Even though the 5th Column may fall this day, our time in the sun is NOT over.<em Victory t=6> We WILL return. I have seen to this personally.<em t=5>Lie in wait within the ranks of the Council. Wait for the sign. <em t=2>Never despair... <em t=3>the time WILL come."

